{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"將軍澳昭信路爆鹹水管　水務署：爭取明晚完成工程\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/WATER-TKO-261126-2015.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】將軍澳昭信路爆鹹水管，水務署表示正維修，爭取明晚完成工程，恢復昭信路、常寧路及寶寧路一帶沖廁水供應。</p><p>鹹水湧出路面，車輛經過要慢駛。立法會議員方國珊表示，下午約六時許接獲居民反映昭信路爆鹹水管，鹹水湧出馬路及附近單車徑，有關路段暫時封路，附近交通較為擠塞，她已通知水務署關閉水掣。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:03:54.103110+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:19:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T12:37:17.640875+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T13:57:26.812427+00:00","content_hash":"998bb9601edb3f6437315fc20121aab3d634d998e70125fc6966be2f11749f75","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:03:54.103110+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}